# The Reference's screen header (tools/make_manual.py --renders): screens only. P6 played, a knob turned ("changed"),
# Wash held: the page's name and the gesture at the left, the sound at the right.
notips
phones 1
set 74 0
set 71 0
tapkey w5
tap PLAY
wait 3000
expect view 0
turn K1 4 150
wait 800
key w15 down
wait 2000
shot r-header-0.png
key w15 up
